{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • Contact</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to schedule a cohort consultation or ask about our integrative programs." />
  <style>
    /* Glass morphism base */
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1724;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      --glass-2: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      --accent:#8DE3B4;
      --accent-2:#6EC5FF;
      --muted:#A7B0C2;
      --card-radius:16px;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#081021 0%,#081224 50%,#061018 100%);color:#eaf2f6}
    body{background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;background-size:240px 240px;}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto;padding:28px;backdrop-filter: blur(8px) saturate(1.05);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),var(--glass-2));border-radius:20px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(3,5,12,0.6)}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#042; font-weight:700}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin:0 8px;padding:8px;border-radius:10px}
    nav a:hover{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:22px;margin-top:26px}
    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:20px;border-radius:var(--card-radius);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:22px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}

    /* Contact form */
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],input[type=tel],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:#eaf2f6;outline:none}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .row .col{flex:1}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:11px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#042;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Proof gallery */
    .proof{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .testimonial{padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.015),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .tenant{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .avatar{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffb3a7,#ffd27a);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#062;font-weight:700}
    .meta small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}
    .badge{position:relative;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);cursor:default}
    .badge:hover .tip{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
    .tip{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,6px);bottom:calc(100% + 8px);white-space:nowrap;background:#021220;color:#d8f7e8;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);opacity:0;transition:all .18s ease}
    .carousel-controls{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);cursor:pointer}
    .dot.active{background:var(--accent)}

    /* Pricing comparator micro */
    .comparator{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.015),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:4px}
    .toggle button{border:0;background:transparent;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .toggle button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#042}
    .price{font-size:28px;font-weight:700}
    .price small{display:block;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .cmp-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}

    footer{margin-top:22px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.03);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width:980px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{margin:16px;padding:18px}.logo{width:48px;height:48px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap" role="main">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">HM</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">A mindful cohort approach to steady wellness</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Programs</a>
        <a href="conditions.html">Ailments</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
        <a href="about.html">Team</a>
        <a href="book.html">Enroll</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="grid" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <div>
        <div class="panel">
          <h1 id="contact-heading">Connect with our cohort concierge</h1>
          <p class="lead">Prefer a quick call, an email note, or a spot in an upcoming small-group intake? Tell us how you'd like to explore—no hard pitches, only practical options.</p>

          <form id="contact-form" autocomplete="on">
            <div class="row">
              <div class="col">
                <label for="name">Your name</label>
                <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="First &amp; last" required />
              </div>
              <div class="col">
                <label for="phone">Phone</label>
                <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="{{PHONE}}" />
              </div>
            </div>

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required />

            <label for="cohort">Interested in</label>
            <select id="cohort" name="cohort">
              <option value="intro">Intro cohort — 6 weeks</option>
              <option value="renew">Renewal cohort — 12 weeks</option>
              <option value="deep">Deep rhythm cohort — 6 months</option>
            </select>

            <label for="message">A note for the intake team</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="What led you here? What are small shifts you'd like to test?" ></textarea>

            <label style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center"><input type="checkbox" id="consent" required /> <span class="muted">I consent to be contacted about cohort options (no spam).</span></label>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px">
              <button class="btn" type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
              <div class="muted">Or write: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
            </div>

            <div id="form-res" class="muted" style="margin-top:8px"></div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div style="height:18px"></div>

        <div class="panel">
          <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:16px">Proof Gallery</h2>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-top:6px">Real notes from our community — rotated for context. Credibility badges explain why folks trust our approach.</p>

          <div class="proof" id="proof-gallery">
            <div class="testimonial" id="testimonial-area">
              <!-- Testimonial injected by JS -->
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
              <div class="badges" id="badges">
                <!-- badges injected by JS -->
              </div>
              <div class="carousel-controls" id="controls"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="panel">
          <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:16px">Quick pricing snapshot</h2>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-top:6px">Toggle to compare monthly access vs package commitment — numbers animate for clarity.</p>

          <div class="comparator" aria-hidden="false">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
              <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing toggle">
                <button id="opt-monthly" class="active" aria-pressed="true">Monthly</button>
                <button id="opt-package" aria-pressed="false">Package</button>
              </div>
              <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">Compare the rhythm</div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:6px">
              <div class="cmp-row">
                <div>
                  <div class="muted">Per person</div>
                  <div class="price" id="price-main">$0</div>
                </div>
                <div style="text-align:right">
                  <div class="muted">Value</div>
                  <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)" id="price-value">—</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Small cohorts, guided sessions, check-ins — choose the cadence that fits your life.</div>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
              <button class="btn" id="join-now">Join an info session</button>
              <button class="btn" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:var(--muted)" id="learn-more">View full options</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:18px"></div>

        <div class="panel">
          <h3 style="margin:0;font-size:15px">Office</h3>
          <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Drop in hours by appointment</div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <div class="muted">Phone</div>
            <div>{{PHONE}}</div>
            <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Email</div>
            <div><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
            <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Location</div>
            <div>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div class="muted">&copy; <span id="yr"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — curious, evidence-minded supportive care.</div>
      <div class="muted">Need urgent help? Contact local services or your primary care provider.</div>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Year
    document.getElementById('yr').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Contact form handling (mock)
    const form = document.getElementById('contact-form');
    const res = document.getElementById('form-res');
    form.addEventListener('submit', function(ev){
      ev.preventDefault();
      res.textContent = 'Thanks — we received your note. A cohort concierge will follow up within 2 business days.';
      form.reset();
      setTimeout(()=>res.textContent='',7000);
    });

    // Proof gallery data
    const proofs = [
      {name:'S. Rivera', role:'Parent & teacher', quote:'The group format helped me test small changes and keep what worked. Gentle accountability, no pressure.', avatar:'SR', tags:['Community-led','Clinically-informed']},
      {name:'M. Patel', role:'Remote engineer', quote:'Practical check-ins and clear next steps — I could use the tools between sessions.', avatar:'MP', tags:['Evidence-aware','Flexible scheduling']},
      {name:'A. Gomez', role:'Care coordinator', quote:'The facilitators layered options and let me choose what fit. It felt collaborative, not prescriptive.', avatar:'AG', tags:['Collaborative','Holistic assessment']}
    ];

    const badges = [
      {label:'Licensed clinicians', tip:'All lead facilitators hold active clinical licenses and follow best-practice standards.'},
      {label:'Peer-tested programs', tip:'Cohorts are refined from feedback cycles with prior participants.'},
      {label:'Data-informed', tip:'We track outcomes to continually improve curriculum and support.'}
    ];

    const testimonialArea = document.getElementById('testimonial-area');
    const badgesArea = document.getElementById('badges');
    const controls = document.getElementById('controls');

    let current = 0;
    function renderTestimonial(i){
      const t = proofs[i];
      testimonialArea.innerHTML = `
        <div class="tenant">
          <div class="avatar">${t.avatar}</div>
          <div class="meta">
            <strong>${t.name}</strong>
            <small>${t.role}</small>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)">${t.quote}</div>
        <div class="badges" style="margin-top:10px">
          ${t.tags.map(tag => `<div class="badge">${tag}</div>`).join('')}
        </div>
      `;
      // dots
      controls.innerHTML = proofs.map((_,idx)=>`<div class="dot ${idx===i?'active':''}" data-idx="${idx}" aria-label="Slide ${idx+1}" tabindex="0"></div>`).join('');
      // attach click
      controls.querySelectorAll('.dot').forEach(d=>d.addEventListener('click',()=>{current = Number(d.dataset.idx); renderTestimonial(current);}));
    }

    // badges with tooltips
    badgesArea.innerHTML = badges.map(b=>`<div class="badge" tabindex="0">${b.label}<div class="tip">${b.tip}</div></div>`).join('');

    renderTestimonial(0);
    let galleryTimer = setInterval(()=>{ current = (current+1)%proofs.length; renderTestimonial(current); }, 4200);
    // pause on hover
    document.getElementById('proof-gallery').addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>clearInterval(galleryTimer));
    document.getElementById('proof-gallery').addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>galleryTimer = setInterval(()=>{ current = (current+1)%proofs.length; renderTestimonial(current); },4200));

    // Pricing comparator micro
    const priceMain = document.getElementById('price-main');
    const priceVal = document.getElementById('price-value');
    const btnMonthly = document.getElementById('opt-monthly');
    const btnPackage = document.getElementById('opt-package');

    const pricing = {
      monthly:{amount:120, value:'Ongoing support'},
      package:{amount:650, value:'6-week cohort bundle'}
    };

    let currentPlan = 'monthly';

    function animateNumber(el, from, to, duration=600){
      const start = performance.now();
      requestAnimationFrame(function step(now){
        const t = Math.min((now-start)/duration,1);
        const val = Math.round(from + (to-from)*t);
        el.textContent = '$' + val;
        if(t<1) requestAnimationFrame(step);
      });
    }

    function setPlan(plan){
      if(plan===currentPlan) return;
      const prev = currentPlan; currentPlan = plan;
      btnMonthly.classList.toggle('active', plan==='monthly');
      btnPackage.classList.toggle('active', plan==='package');
      btnMonthly.setAttribute('aria-pressed', plan==='monthly');
      btnPackage.setAttribute('aria-pressed', plan==='package');
      const from = Number(priceMain.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')) || (plan==='monthly'?pricing.package.amount:pricing.monthly.amount);
      const to = pricing[plan].amount;
      animateNumber(priceMain, from, to);
      priceVal.textContent = pricing[plan].value;
    }

    // initial
    priceMain.textContent = '$' + pricing.monthly.amount;
    priceVal.textContent = pricing.monthly.value;

    btnMonthly.addEventListener('click',()=>setPlan('monthly'));
    btnPackage.addEventListener('click',()=>setPlan('package'));

    // CTA buttons actions (mock)
    document.getElementById('join-now').addEventListener('click',()=>{ window.location.href = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'; });
    document.getElementById('learn-more').addEventListener('click',()=>{ window.location.href = 'pricing.html'; });

    // keyboard controls for dots
    controls.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{
      if(e.key === 'ArrowRight') { current = (current+1)%proofs.length; renderTestimonial(current); }
      if(e.key === 'ArrowLeft') { current = (current-1+proofs.length)%proofs.length; renderTestimonial(current); }
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# holistic_medicine-MORE-2026-02-17T18-39-27-421Z-011

Project: Holistic / Integrative Medicine — glass_morphism layout

Seed: 2766142416

Voice: playful_premium
Offer model: cohort

Chunk: 4 — files included in this bundle
- contact.html
- README.md

Purpose
- contact.html: Contact page with an intake form, embedded micro-interactions to demonstrate community proof (rotating testimonials + badges with tooltips) and a small pricing comparator (monthly vs package) with animated numbers. The page follows a glass-morphism aesthetic and uses only local assets and inline styles/scripts.
- README.md: this file.

Placeholders used (replace in your deployment):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes on interactive features
- Proof Gallery: Rotates through a short set of testimonials every ~4.2s. Hovering the gallery pauses rotation. Credibility badges include a small tooltip that appears on hover/focus to provide context about each credential.
- Pricing Comparator: A two-option toggle (Monthly / Package). Clicking either option animates the main price with a smooth numeric transition and updates a short value summary. Buttons are keyboard accessible and labeled with aria-pressed.

Design & accessibility
- Uses high-contrast glass panels with subtle gradients and clear focusable elements.
- Form fields are labeled, and the CTA is prominent. The gallery controls are keyboard operable.
- No medical claims or guaranteed outcomes are made; the page uses supportive language and suggests contacting local/urgent services in the footer.

Files and dependencies
- This chunk contains only two files listed above. The full site references other pages (index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html).
- The layout expects an SVG asset at assets/img/pattern.svg for the page background. Ensure that file exists in the project assets for visual consistency.
- No external fonts, CDNs, or images are included in this chunk.

Developer notes
- Replace placeholders by your templating system or a simple search-and-replace before publishing.
- The contact form is a mock client-side handler that displays a confirmation message; integrate with your backend or form service as needed.
- The pricing comparator values are example figures; update the pricing object in the script for live data.

Compliance & tone
- The content uses educational, supportive phrasing and avoids claims of cures. On pages that describe conditions or care plans, include disclaimers and encourage users to consult licensed providers.

How to preview locally
1. Ensure the project root contains the referenced pages and assets/img/pattern.svg.
2. Open contact.html in a browser (file:// is adequate for static preview). For best results, serve via a local static server (e.g., `npx serve` or `python -m http.server`).

License
- This bundle is provided for project use. Adapt and modify as needed for your deployment."}
